<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH NUTRECO 1996 NET PROFIT SURGES.</title>
<headline>DUTCH NUTRECO 1996 NET PROFIT SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    40.4  vs  26.0</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   4.56 vs   4.03</p>
<p>    Operating expenses (billion)     4.43 vs   3.92</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   128.1  vs 112.7</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    76.3  vs  75.2</p>
<p>    Tax				     11.2  vs  11.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Animal and fish feeds group Nutreco Holding NV said</p>
<p>it will seek a listing on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange before</p>
<p>the end of this summer.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
